<h2 class="section-heading">Kitchen Essentials Worth Adding</h2>
<p class="section-subheading">Smaller, cheaper add-ons that pair well with TM7 cooking — none of these are TM7-specific, but they solve problems the machine itself doesn't.</p>
<div class="feature-grid">
  <div class="feature">
