    <h3>Silicone Dough Mat</h3>
    <p><strong>~$35 CAD.</strong> A non-stick mat for rolling dough straight from the TM7 without flouring the counter — great if you bake a lot of bread or pastry.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature">
