    <h3>2-in-1 Mixing Bowl Brush</h3>
    <p><strong>~$39 CAD.</strong> A dual-headed brush for the mixing bowl and underside of the blades — the two spots a sponge can't reach, even after the TM7's pre-clean mode.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature">
    <img class="accessory-image" src="https://www.thermomix.ca/cdn/shop/files/05.BreadKnife_b785ee8a-d213-4696-adf9-50199d47c5b2.jpg" alt="Thermomix serrated bread knife" loading="lazy">
